(A) crossings on (0, 1/4], B = infinity (40-digit arithmetic)
    G_1 = H                 : root in [0.0559643499991, 0.0559643499991]; quoted 0.05596 rounds it (below; |diff| = 4.35e-6)
    psi_2(p,1) = H          : root in [0.0778658645966, 0.0778658645966]; quoted 0.07787 rounds it (above; |diff| = 4.14e-6)
    1 - log2(3/2 - p) = H   : root in [0.12330728552, 0.12330728552]; quoted 0.12331 rounds it (above; |diff| = 2.71e-6)
    certificates on (0, 1/4]: (G_1 - H)' < -log2 3 < 0;  (1 - log2(3/2-p) - H)' <= -0.43081 < 0;
      for h(p) = psi_2(p,1) - H(p): y* in [0.73854, 1.3589], and by Danskin
      h'(p) = y*^2 - (2 sqrt(ln2/2) y* - 1/2)/((A + k y*) ln2) - log2((1-p)/p) <= -0.20194 < 0
      (Danskin's formula agrees with central differences at p = 0.03, 0.0779, 0.2 to 1e-8)
